  "verification": "Re-scraped live on 2026-09-13 and diffed against this file, running BOTH methods side by side. Result: 71 of 71 fields match the stored values (the only delta was a string-truncation length on the Email Filter textarea, not a value difference). The sibling-logic method would have differed on 62 of 71 fields - so the trap is real and was avoided here.",
